    },
    {
      "displayText": "胖甜妮，\n別鬧彆扭了啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n去吃吃你總是會吃的那個嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80D6751C59AEFF0C000A52259B275F46626D4E865566300200100001BE00000A53BB540354034F607E3D662F67035403768490A3500B561B3002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咘呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54985462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣啊……這位訓練家，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以幫我一個忙嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A23554A2026202690194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE55E6B62114E00500B5FD955CEFF1F001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的胖甜妮在小罷工，\n不肯工作。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768480D6751C59AE57285C0F7F775DE5FF0C000A4E0D80AF5DE54F5C3002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是平常的話，我會帶牠\n去旭日咖啡館吃個老樣子的東西。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但可惜我得處理這裡的工作。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F5E735E3876848A71FF0C621167035E367260000A53BB65ED65E55496556199285403500B80016A235B5076846771897F300200100001BE00000A4F4653EF60DC62115F9786557406901988E176845DE54F5C3002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，這位訓練家，\n拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳陪胖甜妮去咖啡館吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n沿著南側大道直走，\n就會看到旭日咖啡館了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3966A80D6751C59AE53BB5496556199285427300200100001BE01000A6CBF8457535750745927905376F48D70FF0C000A5C316703770B523065ED65E55496556199284E863002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在旭日咖啡館\n陪一陪胖甜妮囉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3572865ED65E5549655619928000A966A4E00966A80D6751C59AE56C93002001000020114012C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
